#====================================================================
# Draft: zlib test_package should prove static archive can link into DSO
#====================================================================

id:                     E539
trigger_tool:           conan|cmake|clang|ld
phase:                  test_package
error_signature:        zlib_pic_probe|R_AARCH64_ADR_PREL_PG_HI21|relocation|SHARED|libz.a

severity:               2
category:               conan, test-package-pic-probe
match_keywords:         zlib, test_package, CMakeDeps, zlib::zlib, shared library, PIC probe, static archive
title:                  zlib test_package should build a shared-library PIC probe

root_cause:             A normal compress/uncompress round trip proves the zlib API works, but it does not prove that static libz.a was built from PIC objects. The non-PIC failure only appears when the archive is linked into a shared object on AArch64.
affected_scope:         Static zlib packages used by downstream shared-library, plugin, or Python-extension consumers on OHOS.
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/z/zlib/1.3.1.1.1 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           api-roundtrip-plus-shared-library-link
rec_description:        Keep a runtime API smoke test for compress/uncompress, and add a second CMake target that builds a SHARED library linked against zlib::zlib. The shared target catches non-PIC static archives during test_package build, before downstream consumers hit the same relocation.
rec_command:            add_library(zlib_pic_probe SHARED pic_probe.c); target_link_libraries(zlib_pic_probe zlib::zlib)
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               test_package/CMakeLists.txt builds test_zlib and zlib_pic_probe

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      downstream-dso-reproducer
fallback_description:   If CMake test_package cannot be used, build a minimal shared object manually with clang and link it against the packaged libz.a.
fallback_command:       clang -shared pic_probe.c path/to/libz.a -o libzlib_pic_probe.so
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:

forbid_1_pattern:       only run zlibVersion|only compile an executable|empty test_package
forbid_1_reason:        Executable-only tests can pass even when the static archive cannot be linked into DSOs.
forbid_1_consequence:   Higher-level consumers fail later with relocation errors despite zlib test_package passing.



